    "sentence_translations": [
      "What is “Beijing Tan”?",
      "",
      "“Beijing Tan”, also called “Ge You Tang”, has recently become very trendy.",
      "Ge You is a famous Chinese comedian.",
      "In 1993, he was a guest star in the first Chinese sit-com “I Love My Family” as Ji Chunsheng.",
      "Ji Chunsheng only appeared in two episodes and was a lazy glutton that called himself an “inventor”.",
      "His most famous scene was being “paralyzed” on the sofa, begging the family for food.",
      "Perhaps even Ge You didn’t think that, after 23 years, this character would become popular again on the Internet.",
      "A lot of people use this image to express their boredom, or self-abandoned emotions.",
      "Even the floral T-shirt Ji Chunsheng wore in the show became a hot item on Taobao.",
      "Can this explain something about the mental state of some young Chinese people?",
      ""
    ]
  }
